{
  "note": [
    "The CRD contract both operators publish.",
    "hanzo-rs/operator and hanzo-go/operator each assert their generated output",
    "against their own copy of this file, so a Kind, group, plural, short name or",
    "spec field cannot move on one side alone. The copies must be identical; change",
    "them together or the two operators install different CRDs for the same Kind and",
    "the API server accepts both, last write winning.",
    "family: universe = the deployment's own group; kms = kms.<universe>;",
    "chain = bootno.de for every universe, because a chain is the same chain",
    "whoever operates it."
